Spec: Story Maker

Purpose:
  Turn a band's photos and videos into finished social posts a person can publish later.

Structure:
  ./src: Compose program
  ./README.md: Overview for the band

Must:
  Compose is one Rust terminal program and runs on macOS and Linux.
  The person passes folders of photos and video of any length and receives post folders.
  A post is one situation, as a Reel, a Story, or a carousel.
  Nothing is encoded until the person saves a post.
  Posts are written only under the out folder.
  Media, rendered posts, and the settings file stay outside this repo.

Must not:
  Schedule, upload, or attach a platform sound. That is a later program.
  Play video inside the terminal.
  Choose a built-in inference provider.
